commit 92f8ed96be4eacf9200b450edcfc74e470e7d513
Author: Avijit Pal <palavijit713130@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Aug 9 17:29:13 2026 +0000

    refactor(backend): remove no-explicit-any from wrapped (repository + service)
    
    WrappedYearRow and WrappedStatRow interfaces replace Record<string, any>
    for the wrapped year and stat rows. Metadata interface for the JSON blob
    cards/insights/summary/sharePayload. DbStat for stat rows.
    
    createMany added as optional to QueryableDelegate for bulk stat inserts.
    
    597 backend tests pass, all gates green.

