commit 665f32a018b4aeb420e2498d2c4d1656b51fa164
Author: Avijit Pal <palavijit713130@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Aug 9 17:10:35 2026 +0000

    refactor(backend): remove no-explicit-any from library.service, add media type properties to LibraryRow
    
    Added movie/tvShow/anime/book/game/musicAlbum/podcast/course properties
    to LibraryRow interface so the service can detect media type and access
    joined media without casting through any.
    
    LibraryRow now includes all eight optional media relationships that
    Prisma's include clause produces, so the detectMediaType and toResponse
    helpers can use typed property access instead of (item as any).movie.
    
    597 backend tests pass, all gates green.

