commit e2e70fe22f9e757060724189bb59904b3a699e2e
Author: Avijit Pal <palavijit713130@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Aug 9 17:03:33 2026 +0000

    refactor(backend): remove no-explicit-any from 12 more files, replace with typed delegates
    
    Removed file-level eslint-disable for no-explicit-any from:
    - interaction (repository + service): now use LibraryItemWithMetadata and
      typed list item interfaces
    - collection-statistics: uses typed delegate access
    - notification-queue: QueueMetrics interface
    - reminder: MediaWithTitle interface
    - smart-collection: LibraryItemWithMedia interface
    - timeline-event-factory: uses typed delegate
    - search.service: Prisma.InputJsonValue for metadata
    - progress (repository + service): LibraryItemWithMedia interface
    - notifications (repository + service): NotificationRow/PreferenceRow
    - media.repository: uses typed delegate, MediaRow casts
    
    Added upsert to QueryableDelegate interface for notification preferences.
    All 597 backend tests pass, all gates green on both workspaces.
    
    Remaining 11 files keep their file-level disable: analytics (3),
    collections (2), journal (2), library, search.repository, wrapped (2).
    These have higher any counts (11-29) and more complex query patterns
    that need individual attention.

