    Doing it now, in an isolated commit, keeps it out of the diffs of the
    functional changes in this branch. Landing right after the line-ending
    normalization also means both mechanical rewrites are behind us and
    subsequent diffs stay small.
    
    Verified after formatting: typecheck, lint (0 warnings), 20 tests and
    the production build all pass.

